{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52361","headline":"诗 五 · 王梵志","name":"诗 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"梵志与王生，密敦胶[漆]（柒）友。\n共喜[歌一]乐，同欣咏五柳。\n适意叙诗书，清淡盃（一作「盂」）渌[酒]。\n莫怪频追逐，只爲相[知]久。\n（按：此诗原卷中两见，兹据另一重抄处校补。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52361.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52361","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}